Bali (pakéan jero)

Bali mangrupa hiji pausahaan pakéan jero nu operasi di &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika Sarikat&lt;/a&gt;.
Bali ngamimitian usaha taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt; jeung Sara Stein minangka Fay-Miss. Taun &lt;a href="1935"&gt;1935&lt;/a&gt; pausahaan ieu ngarobah ngarana jadi Bali Brassiere Company. Bali ngahiji jeung &lt;a href="Hanes"&gt;Hanes Corporation&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1969"&gt;1969&lt;/a&gt;. Hanes tuluy ngajual ka &lt;a href="Consolidated%20Foods%20Company"&gt;Consolidated Foods Company&lt;/a&gt; nu markasna di &lt;a href="Chicago"&gt;Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, nu jadi &lt;a href="Sara%20Lee%20Corporation"&gt;Sara Lee Corporation&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; Sara Lee misahkeun pausahaan pakéanana ka &lt;a href="HanesBrands%20Inc."&gt;HanesBrands Inc.&lt;/a&gt;. HanesBrands boga mérek pakéan liana, kaasup: &lt;a href="Hanes"&gt;Hanes&lt;/a&gt; (mérek panggedéna), &lt;a href="Champion%20%28pak%C3%A9an%20olahraga%29"&gt;Champion&lt;/a&gt; (mérek panggedéna kadua), &lt;a href="Playtex"&gt;Playtex&lt;/a&gt; (mérek panggedéna katilu), Just My Size, Barely There, &lt;a href="Wonderbra"&gt;Wonderbra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%E2%80%99eggs"&gt;L’eggs&lt;/a&gt;, C9 by Champion, &lt;a href="Duofold"&gt;Duofold&lt;/a&gt;, Beefy-T, Outer Banks, Sol y Oro, Rinbros, Zorba jeung Ritmo.
